                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 19,
                "retweet_count": 12,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "This deal will do nothing to lower health care costs. I will be voting NO.\n\nRepublicans manufactured this health care crisis through their chaos and cruelty.\n\nNow they\u2019re asking families to trust a vague promise of a future vote to lower health care costs. That\u2019s unacceptable. Premiums are skyrocketing. Americans are already stretched thin.\n\nI\u2019ve been fighting to protect coverage, lower costs, and hold the Trump administration accountable. And I\u2019m not stopping now.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
                "text_tagged_users_ids": null,
