                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 3,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I\u2019ve heard from college students worried they\u2019ll lose their mental health care, couples close to retirement being forced to pay thousands to keep their health care, and families who don\u2019t know how they\u2019ll choose between health care, rent, and groceries.\n\nAnd I know my Republican colleagues have heard the same.\n\nBut instead of doing something to extend the EPTC\u2019s, Republicans are putting a sham of a bill on the floor this week just before they expire.",
