                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Instead of caring about the millions of Americans who are being forced to make impossible choices regarding their health care, Speaker Johnson is trying to jam through a sham of a bill.\n\nLet\u2019s vote on a clean extension and avert the cliff. https://t.co/S7kn2hGf75",
